id: goblin
name: Goblin
order: 6
category: body
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
# (2)
grantsOther: monstrous
grantsOtherFrom: unrelenting
description: >
  Small but sturdy, you are more of a pest than threat, but notoriously hard to kill.
text: >
  Goblin (Body): Small but sturdy, you are more of a pest than threat, but notoriously hard to kill.
  (1)-[Passive]: Your base Size Category is Small, but while your Size Category is smaller than Large, you may use the Large Size Category to calculate your Soak Value Bonus/Penalty for your Size Category.
  (2)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Unrelenting Monstrous Trait.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you are hit by an Attacking Maneuver while below the Injured Health Threshold, you may choose to reduce your Life Points to their lowest possible value instead of receiving Damage from that Attacking Maneuver. If you do, and trigger the 3rd effect of Unrelenting, double your Surgency for the duration of the Healing Surge used through its effects.

---

# (2) Its header - in the Other Traits list, gained with it.
[passive]
# (1) Small; the Soak Value's Size bonus a Large one's while smaller (actor-character.mjs).
allow size.base.small;
allow goblin.soakAsLarge;
# (3) Hit, Injured or worse: asked as its Damage is worked out, once a Round - your Life Points their least instead; the Healing Surge
# Unrelenting (3) then gives, its Surgency doubled (chat.mjs goblinDrop, takeSurge).
allow goblin.drop;
